  </div>

  <p>
    Neither list is about being "smarter" versus "friendlier" in some fixed way. Both organisations need
    genuinely strong reasoning and financial judgment. The real split is whether your interest and energy
    point toward policy and regulation, or toward commercial banking and customer relationships.
  </p>

